sub main {
  my $usage=<<"EOT";
Usage: $::program [option...] password channel-URI log-dir
  where option is one or more of:
   -loggerBot <nick>	irc nick of logger bot (default RRSAgent)
   -meetingData <file>	name of configuration file for Start/End Meeting
